syn_map:|        |       |     | because a particular library cell is defined as  |
syn_map:|        |       |     | 'clock_gating_integrated_cell', but 'dont_use'   |
syn_map:|        |       |     | attribute is defined as true in the liberty      |
syn_map:|        |       |     | library. To make Genus use this cell for clock   |
syn_map:|        |       |     | gating insertion, 'dont_use' attribute should be |
syn_map:|        |       |     | set to false.                                    |
syn_map:|        |       |     |To make the cell usable, change the value of      |
syn_map:|        |       |     | 'dont_use' attribute to false.                   |
