syn_opt:|INVS-99 |Info   |    3|Setting Innovus attribute that is not used by     |
syn_opt:|        |       |     | Genus.                                           |
syn_opt:|        |       |     |This attribute exists to allow configuration of   |
syn_opt:|        |       |     | Innovus from Genus.                              |
syn_opt:|LBR-40  |Info   |    6|An unsupported construct was detected in this     |
syn_opt:|        |       |     | library.                                         |
syn_opt:|        |       |     |Check to see if this construct is really needed   |
syn_opt:|        |       |     | for synthesis. Many liberty constructs are not   |
syn_opt:|        |       |     | actually required.                               |
syn_opt:|LBR-41  |Info   |  192|An output library pin lacks a function attribute. |
syn_opt:|        |       |     |If the remainder of this library cell's semantic  |
syn_opt:|        |       |     | checks are successful, it will be considered as a|
syn_opt:|        |       |     | timing-model                                     |
syn_opt:|        |       |     | (because one of its outputs does not have a valid|
syn_opt:|        |       |     | function.                                        |
syn_opt:|LBR-101 |Warning|    3|Unusable clock gating integrated cell found at the|
syn_opt:|        |       |     | time of loading libraries. This warning happens  |
syn_opt:|        |       |     | because a particular library cell is defined as  |
syn_opt:|        |       |     | 'clock_gating_integrated_cell', but 'dont_use'   |
syn_opt:|        |       |     | attribute is defined as true in the liberty      |
syn_opt:|        |       |     | library. To make Genus use this cell for clock   |
syn_opt:|        |       |     | gating insertion, 'dont_use' attribute should be |
syn_opt:|        |       |     | set to false.                                    |
syn_opt:|        |       |     |To make the cell usable, change the value of      |
syn_opt:|        |       |     | 'dont_use' attribute to false.                   |
syn_opt:|LBR-109 |Info   |    3|Set default library domain.                       |
syn_opt:|LBR-162 |Info   |   78|Both 'pos_unate' and 'neg_unate' timing_sense arcs|
syn_opt:|        |       |     | have been processed.                             |
syn_opt:|        |       |     |Setting the 'timing_sense' to non_unate.          |
syn_opt:|LBR-412 |Info   |    6|Created nominal operating condition.              |
syn_opt:|        |       |     |The nominal operating condition is represented,   |
syn_opt:|        |       |     | either by the nominal PVT values specified in the|
syn_opt:|        |       |     | library source                                   |
syn_opt:|        |       |     | (via nom_process,nom_voltage and nom_temperature |
syn_opt:|        |       |     | respectively)                                    |
syn_opt:|        |       |     | , or by the default PVT values (1.0,1.0,1.0).    |
