syn_map.report_synth:        : The design is 'Core'.
syn_map.report_synth:        : Use 'check_timing_intent' or 'report timing -lint' to report more information.
syn_map.report_synth:@flow_step(report_late_paths)  4:   report_timing -max_paths 1   -nworst 1 -path_type full_clock -net > [file join [get_db flow_report_directory] [get_db flow_report_name] setup.worst.rpt]
