syn_map.report_synth:        : The design is 'Core'.
syn_map.report_synth:@flow_step(report_late_paths)  5:   report_timing -max_paths 500 -nworst 1 -path_type full_clock      > [file join [get_db flow_report_directory] [get_db flow_report_name] setup.gba.rpt]
syn_map.report_synth:Warning : Timing problems have been detected in this design. [TIM-11]
syn_map.report_synth:        : The design is 'Core'.
syn_map.report_synth:@flow_step(report_late_paths)  6:   if {![get_feature report_pba]} {
syn_map.report_synth:                                      
syn_map.report_synth:                                      #- Reports that show detailed timing with Path Based Analysis (PBA)
